    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2661 WORK IS MURDER, REVENGE IS SWEET \u2661</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KILLING BOYS</strong> is an LGBTQ+ dark comedy, supernatural visual novel in which you play as EVE, an immortal assassin cursed with the kiss of death, as she turns on her (literal) evil corporate overlords in an attempt to break free of her iron-clad contract. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience betrayal, commit murder, and pursue romance in a story where morals are merely a concept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEMO COMING IN 2025</strong></p>",
